  "note": "protocol = floor(P*f/10000); remainder = P - protocol - runner - sum(parts); reserve = floor(remainder*reserve_bps/10000) -> bond_available; creator = remainder - reserve. protocol+runner+sum(parts)+reserve+creator == price.",
